<<~ ahu slot=`#/purpose`>>

`ask-book.ts` holds what the door knows of a request id in memory for its life: running, abandoned, landed, an act's verdict; one synchronous turn decides, one count bounds it. No receipt rests (lar:///ha.ka.ba/lararium/mesh/receipt-ledger): the book holds memory alone, and a restart empties it. The DAM checklist (<<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lararium/mesh/uds-channel-dam`>>) carries its observations.

